bind Donor Identify: Identifier Donor
bind Contact Initiate: Identifier Donor, Method Contact
bind Meeting Perform: Identifier Donor, Duration Meeting
bind Proposal Compose: Identifier Donor, Amount Donation, State Proposal
bind Proposal Assess: Identifier Donor, State Proposal
bind Proposal Authorize: Identifier Donor, State Proposal
bind Proposal Submit: Identifier Donor, State Proposal
bind Response Accept: Identifier Donor, Category Response
bind Terms Negotiate: Identifier Donor, Category Response
bind Agreement Finalize: Identifier Donor, State Agreement
Identifier Donor: integer between 1 and 1000
Amount Donation: float between 1000.0 and 1000000.0
Method Contact: Email, Phone, In-Person
State Proposal: Drafted, Reviewed, Approved, Submitted
Duration Meeting: integer between 15 and 180
Category Response: Positive, Negative, Neutral
State Agreement: Pending, Finalized
Init[Donor Identify] | |
End[Agreement Finalize] | |
Existence[Proposal Assess] | |
Precedence[Proposal Submit, Proposal Authorize] | |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |
Response[Response Accept, Terms Negotiate] | |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |0,2,d
Chain Response[Meeting Perform, Proposal Compose] | |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |0,48,h
Responded Existence[Proposal Submit, Response Accept] | |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |
Precedence[Proposal Assess, Proposal Compose] | |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |
Co-Existence[Contact Initiate, Meeting Perform] |A.Method Contact is Phone |A.Method Contact == T.Method Contact |
Not Chain Succession[Response Accept, Agreement Finalize] |A.Category Response is Negative |A.Identifier Donor == T.Identifier Donor |